                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for alexey lyashkov &amp;lt;alexey.lyashkov@hpe.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/f1bc6aa0-d478-40da-bdfb-a4ffbab58846" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/f1bc6aa0-d478-40da-bdfb-a4ffbab58846&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_101a failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Timeout occurred after 471 minutes, last suite running was conf-sanity
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/116839" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/116839&lt;/a&gt; - 5.14.0-503.40.1.el9_5.x86_64&lt;br/&gt;
servers: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/116839" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/116839&lt;/a&gt; - 5.14.0-503.40.1_lustre.el9.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;Please provide additional information about the failure here&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Due stack traces analyse - client stick in ldlm enqueue to wait a file creation, but MDT is idle and don't process an rpc. I might be problem with large AT_MAX or some other network issues.&lt;/p&gt;





